  "remaining": [
    "The empty-event contract covers only exact two card names and OnPlayedFromHand. Their selected current classes have no own reflected functions, share BaseCardObject and the same ProcessEvent target; copied-code tests establish the non-native scriptless early return. Keywords, other events, all PvP behavior and entire cards are not certified.",
    "A separate local interpreter entry RVA0x159cf30 is runtime-detoured (first6bytes), origin unresolved. Full Blueprint direct-call upstream ABI/hooks/lifetime and arbitrary object-state paths remain open. The verified ProcessEvent empty branch returns before that interpreter. Do not claim all event invocation mechanisms are recovered.",
    "MakeLiteralText preserves the opaque native FText payload/flags through selected wrapper/copy/move branches. Offline emulation substitutes typed argument reader, empty-text singleton, cookie and refcount contracts; no full FFrame/GC/localization/allocator proof. Simulator uses string identity, including literal null text, not native FText storage.",
    "The reused native capture labels its wrapper GetPlayingSide; function selection/header and complete wrapper RVA0x3dcb680 prove MakeLiteralText. Private capture label548 is not a ledger rule number.",
    "Sidecar must match exact IR and deployed cards.json (normal build copies cards.live.json). Loading raw docs/card-ir.json next to older docs/cards.json fails closed. No variant fallback, unknown-card default or training-admission waiver.",
    "100game execution admission67/1804rows is a bounded health measurement, not rule fidelity or AI strength.33games rejected;9 reason types overlap across games. Full current PvP denominator remains unresolved and whole-card certification0."
